The following is a box with 2 holes whose first hole contains the number
0 and whose second hole contains the number 0.
4!@%!(%@+C!C#C!C!C!C!C!C!C+A!C!C!C!C!C!C+A!C..

NumberTyping = off
TextTyping = off
Flipping = off
FunctionKeys = off
BringInVacuumWhenRobotFails = off

Did you notice that the robot has a magic wand that only he can use? 

You can train the robot if you give him the box with the zero in it.  You'll
end up in his imagination and he'll remember whatever you do.

Once the robot is trained just give him the box and he'll repeat what
he was trained to do.

So here's how I would do this.  I'd pick up the box and drop it on the robot.
Then I'd train the robot to copy the box and drop the copy right next to
the box.  Then I'd give the robot the box and wait for him to copy
and join the box.

